{"headword":"שִׂיחַ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:34\" href=\"/Psalms.104.34\">ψ 104:34</a></sup> <strong>complaint, musing</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.27\">1 K 18:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">Pr 23:29</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.16\">1 S 1:16</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 23:2\" href=\"/Job.23.2\">Jb 23:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.11\">2 K 9:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:1\" href=\"/Psalms.102.1\">ψ 102:1</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>plaint, complaint:</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:13\" href=\"/Job.7.13\">Jb 7:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 9:27\" href=\"/Job.9.27\">9:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:1\" href=\"/Job.10.1\">10:1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מר נפשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Job 21:4\" href=\"/Job.21.4\">21:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 23:2\" href=\"/Job.23.2\">23:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:29\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.29\">Pr 23:29</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:3\" href=\"/Psalms.55.3\">ψ 55:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָהִימָה</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">קוֹלִי בְּשִׂיחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:2\" href=\"/Psalms.64.2\">64:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁפַךְ שׂ׳ לפני י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:1\" href=\"/Psalms.102.1\">102:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:3\" href=\"/Psalms.142.3\">142:3</a>. Foll. are dub.:"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>musing</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.27\">1 K 18:27</a> (E) of a god, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיג לוֹ</span>, (so RV; SS ‘<em>nachdenken</em>’<em>;</em> Buhl ‘<em>beschäftigt sein</em>’<em>;</em> AV <em>talk</em>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:34\" href=\"/Psalms.104.34\">ψ 104:34</a> of man (Buhl SS. Bae ‘<em>Rede</em>, oder <em>Gesang</em>’).—Vid. also [<a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שֵׂחַ²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שֵׂחַ²\">שֵׂחַ</a>] infr."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>anxiety, trouble:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרֹב שִׂיחִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.16\">1 S 1:16</a>; (defined in MT by <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּעַס</span>, cf. HPS; so Buhl SS, but perhaps = <strong>1</strong>)."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>the way in which he talks:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂיחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 9:11\" href=\"/II_Kings.9.11\">2 K 9:11</a>."}],"num":"4."}]},"rid":"BDB09678","strong_numbers":["7878","7879","7880"],"next_hw":"שִׂיחָה","prev_hw":"שׂיח","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["8488","8489","8490"],"TWOT":["2255","2255a","2256a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}